  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EW0zNrq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"781\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Reliquified Ars Nouveau</strong> 是一款连接 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Relics</strong></a> 与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ars Nouveau</strong></a> 的附加模组，为游戏引入了多种独特的遗物。每件遗物都运用了不同的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ars Nouveau</strong></a> 机制，从而解锁其全部潜力并丰富游戏体验。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8z7RJwj.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p>所需依赖项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RELICS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ARS NOUVEAU</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9ESYAYp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"472\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.X：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-ars-nouveau/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MmvYRZJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以在哪里找到本模组的遗物？</strong><br>答：所有遗物均会生成于 Ars Nouveau 或其附加模组所添加的结构或生物群系中。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以将此模组用于整合包吗？</strong><br>答：可以，欢迎加入。</p>\n<p><strong>问：我可以将此模组重新发布到其他平台吗？</strong><br>答：不可以。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLgKo87.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified_ars_nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1196449%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dReliquified%2bArs%2bNouveau%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们的其他模组吗？请访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 获取更多信息！</strong></p>\n</div>",
